{
  "name": "Khanoumi Website Extractor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "#  Automated E-Commerce Price Intelligence & Discount Tracker\n\n### Overview\nAn end-to-end automated ETL & data aggregation pipeline built in **n8n** that continuously monitors e-commerce flash sales,\n cleanses multi-currency/bilingual pricing data, and syncs updates to Google Sheets in near real-time.\n\n---\n\n### Architecture & Technical Highlights\n\n* **Headless Browser Orchestration (Browserless.io / Chromium):**\n  Bypasses client-side rendering (CSR/SSR) bottlenecks and dynamic DOM injection (React/Next.js) \nby orchestrating a remote headless Chrome instance with selector-wait conditions (`waitForSelector: a.relative`).\n\n* **DOM Parsing & Regex Transformation:**\n  Extracts unstructured HTML fragments, parses multi-tier pricing, \nhandles Persian/Arabic numeral normalization to numeric formats, and filters exclusive badge attributes (`جدید`).\n\n* **Stateful Deduplication & Cache Layer:**\n  Leverages execution-persisted hashing to filter out previously ingested product URLs, drastically reducing redundant write operations and quota consumption.\n\n* **Idempotent Data Sync (Google Sheets):**\n  Executes an upsert workflow (`appendOrUpdate`) matching primary keys (`Product Name` / `URL`) to prevent row fragmentation and maintain historical price accuracy.\n\n---\n\n### Tech Stack\n`n8n` • `Headless Chrome / Browserless` • `JavaScript (ES6+)` • `DOM / CSS Selectors` • `Google Sheets API` • `ETL Pipelines`",
        "height": 768,
        "width": 1664,
        "color": 3
      },
